10. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.
If we make material changes, such as significantly expanding the types of personal information we collect, we will provide notice through the Website or your registered email address at least
30 days before the changes take effect
, where required.
The updated version will be posted on this page with a revised “Last Updated” date.
11. Contact Us
If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or the handling of your personal information, please contact:
Email:
support@echobae.com
Thank you for choosing
echobae.com
.
